    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt. The prompt asks for \"a 15-second, 1:1 square-framed video depicting a professional industrial brand story with two adults in work attire interacting around a scooter in a clean workshop.\" \n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\nThe overall visual quality is solid and consistent with a high-quality production. The resolution is clear, lighting is stable, and colors are well-balanced across scenes. There are no major artifacts or distortions, and the framing remains coherent throughout. However, there are occasional minor softness and slight color variation in some frames that prevent a perfect top-tier score. Overall, Visual Quality aligns with a strong 4.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\nThe video largely satisfies the prompt requirements: it presents two adults in work attire (one in orange overalls with a blue hard hat, the other in gray overalls with a white hard hat) around a scooter in a clean workshop, with a 1:1 aspect ratio and a professional industrial setting. The core elements—two people, workwear, a scooter, and an industrial backdrop—are clearly represented. Some aspects of the exact sequence and pacing of actions are not perfectly synchronized with the prompt, but the overall alignment remains strong, supporting a score of 4.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency:\nThe scene maintains plausible human proportions, natural interactions, and believable spatial relationships between the workers and the scooter. Lighting, shadows, and reflections are coherent, and there are no obvious physics violations. A few minor timing or positioning nuances exist, yet they do not undermine overall realism. This yields a solid 4 for Physical/Common-sense Consistency.\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality = 4; Text-to-Video Alignment = 4; Physical/Common-sense Consistency = 4.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
